time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          (for example by using `find_namespace_packages(...)`/`find_namespace:`"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          instead of `find_packages(...)`/`find:`)."
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          You can read more about \"package discovery\" on setuptools documentation page:"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          - https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/package_discovery.html"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          If you don't want 'openstackdocstheme.theme.starlingxdocs_pdf' to be distributed and are"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          already explicitly excluding 'openstackdocstheme.theme.starlingxdocs_pdf' via"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          `find_namespace_packages(...)/find_namespace` or `find_packages(...)/find`,"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          you can try to use `exclude_package_data`, or `include-package-data=False` in"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          combination with a more fine grained `package-data` configuration."
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          You can read more about \"package data files\" on setuptools documentation page:"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          - https://setuptools.pypa.io/en/latest/userguide/datafiles.html"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          [^1]: For Python, any directory (with suitable naming) can be imported,"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="                even if it does not contain any `.py` files."
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="                On the other hand, currently there is no concept of package data"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="                directory, all directories are treated like packages."
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="          ********************************************************************************"
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug
time="2025-03-12T07:10:36Z" level=debug msg="  !!"
